38,2,1,talk,Midori,,Three people said they wouldn't turn away a neighbour's late bag.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,Filing a permanent build takes four months and five signatures.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
