42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"The subsidy only covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"If nobody wants to enforce rules, how do we manage it?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
