46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The bin house smells worse than the open pile by midsummer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,So we can't afford a full enclosure without a big outlay.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need a solution that doesn't create new enemies.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,Twenty supervised mornings a year per house is manageable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I think we need to share the burden more evenly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,An enclosed structure might just trap the smell.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Rotating the location might spread the cost and the annoyance.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,Managed hours could work if we all agree to the rules.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let's vote on what seems most sustainable.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
